<%-- 
  BarTender Template: product-label.btw
  Dimensions: 32mm x 22mm (or standard label dimensions)
  
  Required Named Data Sources (SubStrings):
  - ProductName: Text field for the product name
  - ProductCode: Text field for the product ID / code (e.g. #0001)
  - Price: Text field for the price
  - BatchNumber: Text field for the batch number
  - Barcode: Barcode object (EAN-13 / Code 128) bound to the barcode value
